  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Psychosocial counselling centre in northern Gaza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is providing financial support to Islamic Relief to run a specialised psychosocial counselling centre for children and parents in the Northern Governate of Gaza, the governate most exposed to violence from incursions.  The project targets approximately 200 children of preschool and school age (4-18 years old) for both individual and group counselling, to help them overcome their trauma and stress.</narrative>
  </description>
